<title>USA: DSI-Digital Solutions names Kelly CFO.</title>
<headline>DSI-Digital Solutions names Kelly CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH PLAINFIELD, N.J. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSI-Digital Solutions Inc said on Wednesday that it has named Donald Kelly chief financial officer, replacing Kenneth Brice, who is leaving the company.</p>
<p>Kelly was previuosly chief financial officer of Wireless Cable International Inc of Warren, N.J.</p>
